==English==

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|frm|monétaire}}, from {{der|en|LL.|monētārius|t=pertaining to money}}, from {{der|en|la|monētārius|t=of a mint}}, from {{m|la|monēta|t=mint, coinage}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/ˈmʌnɪtɹi/|/ˈmʌnɪtəɹi/}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|en|/ˈmɑnɪteɹi/|/ˈmʌnəteɹi/}}
* {{audio|en|Monetary US.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# Of, pertaining to, or consisting of [[money]].

